WEBVTT

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
moo-shi

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
presents:

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
http://moo-shi.no-ip.info/ #moo-shi@irc.rizon.net

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:51.760
<i>Half a year has passed since then.</i>

00:01:55.230 --> 00:01:55.990
Kosuna...

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:17.550
<i>M-Master!</i>

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:32.060
<i>I went there several times afterwards
to look around the place,</i>

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:36.280
<i>but all that was left
was sand and rubble.</i>

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:45.260
<i>Even so, I always felt my master
might just stroll in out of the blue...</i>

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:48.130
<i>...but he never did.</i>

00:02:50.210 --> 00:02:54.370
<i>I suppose he really did die after all...</i>

00:02:55.490 --> 00:02:59.620
<i>Even when I offer him his
favorite bug dumplings like this,</i>

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:03.930
<i>I'm still unable to come to grips with it.</i>

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:14.060
<i>"Asshole" "Go to hell!" "Moron"</i>

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:14.060
<i>Master...</i>

00:03:15.660 --> 00:03:21.580
<i>He was tightfisted, vile,
and always greedy to the max,</i>

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:25.100
<i>not to mention a diabolical
and cruel person...</i>

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:31.470
<i>...but at the very end,
he was truly admirable!</i>

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:46.030
<i>B-but just you watch, Master!</i>

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:50.290
<i>I, Koizumi Taiko, in order to become
the desert's most skilled beauty...</i>

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:53.850
<i>Yes, as Sunabouzu the 2nd,
I will work my very hardest!</i>

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:06.090
<i>J-just you watch!</i>

00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:09.330
<i>Matsunami Winches</i>

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:15.350
<i>Yay!</i>

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:18.880
<i>Yay!</i>

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:21.890
<i>At last... I've bought it!</i>

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:26.720
<i>A Matsunami Custom Order-Made
Rocket Winch!</i>

00:04:27.470 --> 00:04:29.350
<i>You know how to use it, right?</i>

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:33.020
<i>Yes! I practiced using my master's!</i>

00:04:33.630 --> 00:04:34.560
<i>Ah.</i>

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:38.420
<i>Don't get too reckless, now.</i>

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:43.280
<i>I can't afford to lose any more
clients in these hard economic times...</i>

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:45.120
<i>"Any more"?</i>

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:52.120
<i>To think guys who seemed impossible
to kill would die so easily...</i>

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:56.240
<i>There's no understandin' the world.</i>

00:04:57.930 --> 00:04:59.090
<i>Actually, my master...</i>

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:05.470
<i>...said that he would use
nothing but Matsunami Customs.</i>

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:14.100
<i>OK! All set! Just lemme know
if you ever want something tuned up!</i>

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:15.060
<i>Right!</i>

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:19.100
<i>U-umm...</i>

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:22.360
<i>Mitsuru! When did you get back?!</i>

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:24.830
<i>Umm... Well...</i>

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:28.450
<i>Did you finish walking the
Heracles Goldion Beetle already?!</i>

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:31.140
<i>Well... Mugenya-san said...</i>

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:32.010
<i>Huh?!</i>

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:33.950
<i>...he has work.</i>

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:37.830
<i>Ugh! Why didn't you say so sooner?!</i>

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:38.960
<i>I-I'm sorry!</i>

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:42.750
<i>Okay, Matsunami-san! Thank you very much!</i>

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:44.530
<i>No problem. Take care, now.</i>

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:45.950
<i>Let's go, Mitsuru!</i>

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:46.760
<i>W-wait!</i>

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:51.640
<i>Matsunami-san!</i>

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:55.520
<i>I'm going to work my hardest,
so you work your hardest, too!</i>

00:05:57.440 --> 00:06:02.320
<i>Yeah, I know. I do have
six brats to feed and all.</i>

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:05.310
<i>Bye, now!</i>

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:07.660
<i>What're you just standing around for?!</i>

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:08.900
<i>S-sorry!</i>

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:10.870
<i>Honestly! You're so hopeless!</i>

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:13.870
<i>This spaz of a kid is Mitsuru.</i>

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:16.980
<i>My master's master, Koidemizu-san,</i>

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:21.290
<i>said it'd be tough to work alone,
so he stuck him with me as a pupil.</i>

00:06:23.430 --> 00:06:26.450
<i>I appreciate Koidemizu-san's kindness,</i>

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:32.220
<i>but the kid screws up at everything
and is an absolutely useless flake.</i>

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:36.130
<i>But... so was I, once...</i>

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:46.280
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:46.280
<i>Handyman Guild - Mugenya</i>

00:06:46.650 --> 00:06:48.110
<i>The Kawazu Clan?!</i>

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:52.870
<i>Y-yes, that's right...</i>

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:56.310
<i>But my master
took care of them before!</i>

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:59.560
<i>Well, they've apparently re-formed,</i>

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:04.380
<i>so the Commerce Association
wants them taken care of right away...</i>

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:10.680
<i>Very well! Leave it to me,
Handyman Kosuna!</i>

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:15.300
<i>No, it's still too much for you,
so the Kawaguchi Brothers...</i>

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:19.520
<i>No! I insist that you let me do it!</i>

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:27.520
<i>A-are you sure? I see you
have an assistant now, but...</i>

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:34.880
<i>We'll be fine!</i>

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:38.240
<i>As inheritor of all of the
Sunabouzu's techniques, I, Kosuna...</i>

00:07:38.240 --> 00:07:40.130
<i>No! As Sunabouzu the 2nd...</i>

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:44.170
<i>...I promise I will crush
the Kawazu Clan flat!</i>

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:46.610
<i>So hot.</i>

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:49.170
<i>Water Station #30</i>

00:07:57.110 --> 00:07:58.260
<i>But with that said...</i>

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:00.000
<i>*glance*</i>

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:02.060
<i>*eep*</i>

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:08.020
<i>This kid won't be any help.
I'll have to do it all myself...</i>

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:11.550
<i>U-umm... I'm sorry...</i>

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:14.330
<i>Listen, you!</i>

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:16.440
<i>What's the matter, Taiko-chan?</i>

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:22.080
<i>Well? How about a quick drink?</i>

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:22.910
<i>Sure...</i>

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:30.970
<i>- Another cold one, barkeep!
- Same here!</i>

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:33.960
<i>- Yo, Taiko-chan!
- How's it goin' lately?</i>

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:35.500
<i>Decent enough!</i>

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:40.930
<i>Must be nice not havin' that
asshole punk pushin' you around, huh?</i>

00:08:40.930 --> 00:08:45.450
<i>But it's just like Kanta to kick
the bucket without paying his tab...</i>

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:47.740
<i>I apologize! If that's true, then I'll...</i>

00:08:47.740 --> 00:08:52.060
<i>Don't worry about it, Taiko-chan!
You don't owe anything!</i>

00:08:52.060 --> 00:08:56.780
<i>Besides, it's well worth the price
to be rid of that scab!</i>

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:59.690
<i>He was called "Ghost of the Desert"
or whatever,</i>

00:08:59.690 --> 00:09:04.240
<i>but he was just an ordinary guy...
I mean ordinary shitsack!</i>

00:09:05.780 --> 00:09:08.730
<i>Oh, yeah! I hear...</i>

00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:18.470
<i>Honestly, what are they thinking?!</i>

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:22.300
<i>They stuck Master with tons of
tough jobs they couldn't do!</i>

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:24.520
<i>Eh? What's wrong?</i>

00:09:25.680 --> 00:09:26.950
<i>Nothing at all!</i>

00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:27.940
<i>S-sorry!</i>

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:33.280
<i>I-it's nothing at all...</i>

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:39.530
<i>That sound...</i>

00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:45.410
<i>A 7.62 millimeter?</i>

00:09:48.930 --> 00:09:50.680
<i>Alright, bastards!</i>

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:55.240
<i>This is West Oasis territory!
What do you think you bandits're doin'?!</i>

00:09:55.870 --> 00:09:59.140
<i>We only set out to
sell some wares! Why us?!</i>

00:09:59.140 --> 00:10:00.730
<i>Honey!</i>

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:02.140
<i>I'm hungry!</i>

00:10:04.740 --> 00:10:09.470
<i>Don't worry! With us here, they won't
be layin' a single finger on you!</i>

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:17.830
<i>The Kawaguchi Brothers?
Who're they fighting?!</i>

00:10:22.770 --> 00:10:25.160
<i>Hey, Haruo! How're you holdin' up?</i>

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:28.790
<i>Just fine, Brother! The Kawazu Clan's
starting to scurry off!</i>

00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:32.080
<i>Don't let your guard down!
They could still be anywhere!</i>

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:34.590
<i>The Kawazu Clan?!</i>

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:46.930
<i>I found a good sucker!</i>

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:55.160
<i>Now that I'm out here...</i>

00:10:56.790 --> 00:10:59.050
<i>The boss is gonna kill me.</i>

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:02.130
<i>I wouldn't worry
about that if I were you!</i>

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:02.780
<i>W-who's there?!</i>

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:18.130
<i>Over there?!</i>

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:21.070
<i>Over here!</i>

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:37.690
<i>Ow...</i>

00:11:38.890 --> 00:11:39.800
<i>Ow...</i>

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:43.880
<i>Way to go, Matsunami Custom!
All's well that ends well!</i>

00:11:45.650 --> 00:11:47.180
<i>T-Taiko-san!</i>

00:11:49.210 --> 00:11:52.730
<i>I told you to call me
"Kosuna-sensei" during jobs!</i>

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:54.460
<i>Sorry!</i>

00:11:55.510 --> 00:11:56.990
<i>I-I apologize!</i>

00:12:01.270 --> 00:12:02.510
<i>Ah, well.</i>

00:12:02.690 --> 00:12:07.390
<i>Guess I'll show you the
Sunabouzu-style of doing things now.</i>

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:08.240
<i>Eh?</i>

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:11.460
<i>Mitsuru! You're going
to help too, of course!</i>

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:12.520
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:26.330
<i>Huh? The West Oasis hired bodyguards?</i>

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:30.410
<i>Yes! A group o' three
real good machine gun guys!</i>

00:12:30.920 --> 00:12:34.920
<i>They caught us totally by surprise,
so we couldn't do a thing...</i>

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:43.040
<i>Ah, well. I'll kill 'em sooner or later.</i>

00:12:45.270 --> 00:12:49.400
<i>Now that the detestable
Sunabouzu is long dead,</i>

00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:54.530
<i>there's no one left who can defy
our re-formed Neo Kawazu Gang.</i>

00:12:54.530 --> 00:12:55.620
<i>R-right!</i>

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:58.960
<i>That's the boss of the reborn
Neo Kawazu Gang for you!</i>

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:01.320
<i>He's dependable to the end!</i>

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:05.110
<i>This time it's gelatin...</i>

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:07.200
<i>Neo Kawazu Clan Boss Neo Kawazu Makoto, Age 38</i>

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:11.360
<i>Gelatin, gelatin! My dear gelatin!</i>

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:15.000
<i>It's almost like it's alive!
Mmm! Yummy!</i>

00:13:15.340 --> 00:13:21.710
<i>Wait, you're lacking in numbers.
You almost had me fooled...</i>

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:26.110
<i>A-actually, Katsumi just fell behind...</i>

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:27.720
<i>Don't worry! He'll be back soon!</i>

00:13:27.980 --> 00:13:29.260
<i>B-bad news!</i>

00:13:30.070 --> 00:13:31.200
<i>What's wrong?!</i>

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:32.770
<i>When I went to look for Katsumi,</i>

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.560
<i>I found him knocked out and buck naked!</i>

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:42.390
<i>And then... there was
this letter on his crotch!</i>

00:13:40.610 --> 00:13:42.690
<i>To Kawazu Makoto</i>

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:45.990
<i>Letter? From whom?</i>

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:52.030
<i>W-well, you won't believe it,
but it's from the Sunabouzu!</i>

00:13:54.130 --> 00:13:57.860
<i>- The Sunabouzu?!
- No way! He died half a year ago!</i>

00:13:57.860 --> 00:13:59.800
<i>It's gotta be some mistake!</i>

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:01.000
<i>Read it.</i>

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:03.000
<i>Yes, sir!</i>

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:09.110
"Dear Neo Kawazu Boss.
Your mommy has an outie!"

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:14.580
"A huge outie! Such a gigantic outie!
A humongous outie..."

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:18.730
<i>Mommy does not have an outie!</i>

00:14:21.390 --> 00:14:25.340
<i>- The boss is mad!
- It's his Hulkosis again!</i>

00:14:27.150 --> 00:14:30.160
<i>Hurry! Give him his jiggly gelatin!</i>

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:40.150
<i>Sunabouzu!</i>

00:14:40.630 --> 00:14:43.890
<i>Nothing could make me
happier than you being back!</i>

00:14:43.890 --> 00:14:46.510
<i>This time I will kill you
with my own two hands!</i>

00:14:48.800 --> 00:14:53.060
<i>- H-here he comes! It's the Sunabouzu!
- C'mon, I'm right here! Bring it on!</i>

00:14:54.320 --> 00:14:57.340
<i>Alright! Everyone ready!</i>

00:15:14.740 --> 00:15:16.940
<i>Well?! Did we get him?!</i>

00:15:16.940 --> 00:15:18.450
<i>Just a moment!</i>

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:22.130
<i>Bastard's good at usin'
balloons and other cheap tricks!</i>

00:15:22.130 --> 00:15:23.700
<i>Don't let 'im fool you!</i>

00:15:24.870 --> 00:15:26.110
<i>T-there he is!</i>

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:27.710
<i>He's running away like mad!</i>

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:30.550
<i>You're sure it ain't
just another balloon?!</i>

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:35.050
<i>No, it's really him!
He's running on two legs!</i>

00:15:35.490 --> 00:15:38.630
<i>Alright! Don't let him escape!
After him!</i>

00:15:38.630 --> 00:15:42.390
<i>- But, Boss! It could be a trap...
- You shit!</i>

00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:47.940
<i>Even if he's got mines, ain't no way
he can kill this many so easy!</i>

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:51.070
<i>Just chase him! Chase him
to the ends of the earth!</i>

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:16.350
<i>Nobody says my mommy has an outie
and gets away with it!</i>

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:18.010
<i>Don't let him escape, no matter what!</i>

00:16:26.640 --> 00:16:28.190
<i>Fool! Now you're...</i>

00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:29.440
<i>Wha?</i>

00:16:30.410 --> 00:16:32.160
<i>Who're you guys?</i>

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:46.840
<i>What is this?!</i>

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:07.310
<i>Damn! Not again!</i>

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:23.610
<i>How in the world...</i>

00:17:23.610 --> 00:17:25.180
<i>It was thanks to you.</i>

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:30.210
<i>Couldn't rely on mines
in this wide-open space,</i>

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:32.960
<i>and there were way
too many to snipe off!</i>

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:37.810
<i>I didn't think it would
work this great, though!</i>

00:17:37.810 --> 00:17:41.010
<i>Good thing I heard the
taboo phrase from my master!</i>

00:17:41.640 --> 00:17:43.060
<i>Taboo phrase?</i>

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:46.290
<i>Yep! "Your mommy has an outie!"</i>

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:49.120
<i>My...</i>

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:52.270
<i>My mommy does not...</i>

00:17:53.220 --> 00:17:55.740
<i>...have an outie!</i>

00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:03.450
<i>Kosuna-san!</i>

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:09.880
<i>Idiot... I said to call me...
Kosuna-sensei...</i>

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:13.880
<i>You ain't the Sunabouzu!</i>

00:18:14.090 --> 00:18:17.420
<i>How dare you trick me!</i>

00:18:23.440 --> 00:18:25.310
<i>Die!</i>

00:18:46.880 --> 00:18:47.660
<i>Y-you're!</i>

00:18:58.640 --> 00:18:59.720
<i>Mitsuru!</i>

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:01.410
<i>He's...</i>

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:08.020
<i>Eh? Mitsuru-kun as my assistant?</i>

00:19:08.470 --> 00:19:13.660
<i>I figure things might be rough
if you set out as a lone handyman now.</i>

00:19:13.660 --> 00:19:17.640
<i>B-but isn't he your dear son?!</i>

00:19:17.640 --> 00:19:21.260
<i>No, this boy'll be
a handyman too, someday.</i>

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:23.910
<i>So he really should be
trained as soon as possible...</i>

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:30.250
<i>It's rude of me to say this, but...</i>

00:19:31.990 --> 00:19:35.500
<i>I know what you want
to say, Taiko-chan. Still...</i>

00:19:36.370 --> 00:19:41.010
<i>He just might be of use, should you
ever find yourself in trouble...</i>

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:44.260
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:19:44.930 --> 00:19:48.430
<i>So this is what Koidemizu-san
was talking about...</i>

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:08.200
<i>W-wait, s-stop!</i>

00:20:17.530 --> 00:20:20.910
<i>Mommy... does not have an outie.</i>

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:31.530
<i>A-alright! Well done, Mitsuru!</i>

00:20:36.530 --> 00:20:40.690
<i>W-wait! I'm your master, you know!</i>

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:45.010
<i>W-we need to sit down and talk!</i>

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:52.370
<i>We can be supportive siblings!
Desert people need to help each other...</i>

00:21:08.530 --> 00:21:14.080
<i>I think I may have
one hell of bomb on my hands!</i>

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:26.450
<i>I later learned that
Mitsuru developed his Hulkosis</i>

00:21:26.450 --> 00:21:31.000
<i>after being subjected to a great
emotional shock at the age of three.</i>

00:21:31.780 --> 00:21:37.060
<i>Ugh! Why do I, the master,
have to carry my pupil back!</i>

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:45.420
<i>Still...</i>

00:21:45.930 --> 00:21:50.660
<i>Will I be able to fully utilize
this boy later on down the road?</i>

00:21:56.880 --> 00:21:59.080
<i>Natsuko-san! You came!</i>

00:22:00.100 --> 00:22:01.610
<i>Hey!</i>

00:22:05.620 --> 00:22:09.840
<i>Regardless, as Sunabouzu the 2nd,
I'm going to work my very best</i>

00:22:09.840 --> 00:22:13.200
<i>to be Koizumi Taiko, the Great
Kanto Desert's most skilled beauty!</i>

00:23:55.670 --> 00:23:58.140
<i>Tadah! It's Skilled Beauty
of the Desert, Kosuna!</i>

00:23:58.140 --> 00:23:59.950
<i>- How was my adorable performance?!
- Umm...</i>

00:24:00.440 --> 00:24:02.280
<i>Great, wasn't it, Mitsuru?!</i>

00:24:02.280 --> 00:24:04.750
<i>I'm sorry! I cooked
and ate the Goldion Beetle!</i>

00:24:04.750 --> 00:24:05.990
<i>You dimwit!</i>

00:24:05.990 --> 00:24:07.770
<i>Anyways, next episode is "Rain and Sea"!</i>

00:24:08.040 --> 00:24:08.790
<i>Miss it and...</i>

00:24:08.790 --> 00:24:10.270
<i>I'm hungry!</i>
